/E (As the iterations before, the tenth iteration of SGSITS MUN presents the Rules of Procedure to be followed in the DISEC Committees, which is a hybrid of the UNA-USA\(parliamentary\) and UN4MUN procedures so that the delegates are ready for any MUN which may come their way. )
/Pg 11 0 R
